# Installation Complete

The estate converger passed its self-test and is running. There is nothing to run by hand.

Within 2 minutes your `~/.estate` runs from a release of main. The Delivery panel on /fleet
shows each converge, the pull requests it delivered, and how long each took from merge to
operating.

## Uninstalling

The converger is the label `ai.estate.converge` in the system domain. Its files are
`/usr/local/estate` and `/Library/LaunchDaemons/ai.estate.converge.plist`.
